      "title": "Mahadev betting app case: CBI raids 33 locations across six States following disclosures from key accused",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/mahadev-betting-app-case-cbi-searches-in-6-states-lead-to-recovery-of-digital-devices-key-documents/article71701007.ece",
