    {
      "title": "CBI searches 33 locations in six states in Mahadev betting app case",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/cbi-searches-33-locations-in-six-states-in-mahadev-betting-app-case-126111400410_1.html",
      "description": "The CBI has conducted searches at 33 locations across six states in connection with its investigation into Mahadev online betting app case, recovering digital devices, mobile phones and documents indicating the use of mule bank accounts and hawala channels, officials said on Saturday.\nThe agency said the searches were conducted on the basis of disclosures made by Sourabh Chandrakar, one of the platform's principal promoters, following his extradition from Oman.\nThe searches, carried out over the past few days, targeted premises linked to panel operators of the betting platform, they said.\nThe CBI spokesperson said live betting and gambling panels were found operating at several locations and subsequently dismantled.\nChandrakar was extradited from Oman and arrested by the CBI on November 1.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-11-14T05:04:20"
    }
  ]
